{"title":"James","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"James"},"headingText":"James","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n::: {.book-summary}\n## Book Summary Insight\n\nJames emphasizes practical Christian living, teaching that authentic faith produces visible obedience, wisdom, humility, and perseverance.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 1\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 1:22</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Be ye doers of the word</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nCore message of James\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter teaches perseverance through trials and the importance of obedient faith. The key verse emphasizes being doers of God's Word rather than merely hearers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 2\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 2:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Faith without works is dead</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nOne of the most discussed NT verses\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter condemns favoritism and explains the relationship between faith and works. The key verse teaches that genuine faith demonstrates itself through action.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 3\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 3:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The wisdom that is from above</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nGodly wisdom\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter addresses the power of the tongue and the nature of true wisdom. The key verse highlights the need for self-control in speech and wisdom from above.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 4\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 4:7</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Submit yourselves therefore to God</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nSpiritual warfare and humility\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter warns against worldliness, pride, and self-reliance. The key verse calls believers to submit themselves humbly to God.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 5\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 5:16</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The effectual fervent prayer of a righteous man availeth much</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFamous prayer verse\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter addresses wealth, patience, prayer, and restoration. The key verse emphasizes the effectiveness of fervent, righteous prayer.\n:::\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n# James\n\n::: {.book-summary}\n## Book Summary Insight\n\nJames emphasizes practical Christian living, teaching that authentic faith produces visible obedience, wisdom, humility, and perseverance.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 1\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 1:22</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Be ye doers of the word</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nCore message of James\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter teaches perseverance through trials and the importance of obedient faith. The key verse emphasizes being doers of God's Word rather than merely hearers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 2\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 2:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Faith without works is dead</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nOne of the most discussed NT verses\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter condemns favoritism and explains the relationship between faith and works. The key verse teaches that genuine faith demonstrates itself through action.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 3\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 3:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The wisdom that is from above</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nGodly wisdom\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter addresses the power of the tongue and the nature of true wisdom. The key verse highlights the need for self-control in speech and wisdom from above.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 4\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 4:7</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Submit yourselves therefore to God</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nSpiritual warfare and humility\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter warns against worldliness, pride, and self-reliance. The key verse calls believers to submit themselves humbly to God.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 5\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">James 5:16</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The effectual fervent prayer of a righteous man availeth much</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFamous prayer verse\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter addresses wealth, patience, prayer, and restoration. The key verse emphasizes the effectiveness of fervent, righteous prayer.\n:::\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["../../styles/bible.css"],"toc":true,"toc-depth":3,"number-sections":false,"output-file":"james.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Othe